><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250701134409+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250701134412+10'00'" name="65007647-2ee2-4a49-ad45-56587dd83a45" page="22" coords="355.266510,327.063416,594.857361,327.063416,355.266510,317.204559,594.857361,317.204559,343.311340,316.602661,594.856873,316.602661,343.311340,306.743805,594.856873,306.743774,343.311707,306.141907,594.858154,306.141846,343.311707,296.283020,594.858154,296.282959,343.311462,295.681091,594.856567,295.681152,343.311462,285.822205,594.856567,285.822266,343.311371,285.220398,594.857727,285.220337,343.311371,275.361511,594.857727,275.361481,343.311890,274.759583,594.856812,274.759521,343.311890,264.900726,594.856812,264.900665,343.311676,264.298767,594.855835,264.298828,343.311676,254.439911,594.855835,254.439972,343.311523,253.838089,594.856567,253.838058,343.311523,243.979218,594.856567,243.979187,343.311523,243.377304,594.857300,243.377243,343.311523,233.518433,594.857300,233.518372,343.311310,232.916489,594.856140,232.916458,343.311310,223.057617,594.856140,223.057587,343.311951,222.455704,594.856812,222.455765,343.311951,212.596832,594.856812,212.596893,343.311768,211.995010,594.855225,211.994949,343.311768,202.136139,594.855225,202.136078,343.311798,201.534195,594.857666,201.534256,343.311798,191.675323,594.857666,191.675385,343.311859,191.073502,594.858093,191.073349,343.311859,181.214630,594.858093,181.214478,343.311584,180.612595,594.855408,180.612656,343.311584,170.753723,594.855408,170.753784,343.311890,170.151901,594.854980,170.247437,343.311890,160.293030,594.854980,160.292969,343.311462,159.691086,594.856750,159.691055,343.311462,149.832214,594.856750,149.832184,343.311707,149.230301,594.856506,149.230362,343.311707,139.371429,594.856506,139.371490,343.311462,138.769608,594.856384,138.769547,343.311462,128.910736,594.856384,128.910675,343.311981,128.308792,594.856689,128.308746,343.311981,118.449921,594.856689,118.449875,343.311768,117.847992,594.857361,117.847946,343.311768,107.989120,594.857361,107.989075,343.311462,107.387192,395.267273,107.387146,343.311462,97.528320,395.267273,97.528275" rect="343.000793,97.220184,595.166260,327.371521" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>COVID-19 has had devastating effects on communities globally,&#xD;leading to significant restrictions on all sectors of society, including&#xD;sport. In a COVID-19 environment, sport has an important&#xD;role to play in restoring normality. Sport Organisations and athletes&#xD;will be faced with complex decisions regarding resumption&#xD;of training activities in the current circumstances. ‘The AIS Framework&#xD;for Rebooting Sport in a COVID-19 Environment’ is based on&#xD;current available evidence, extrapolated into the sporting context&#xD;by specialists in sport and exercise medicine, infectious diseases&#xD;and public health. The AIS Framework provides a timely tool for&#xD;sport organisations to guide the cautious and methodical resumption&#xD;of sport activity (the ‘</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal"
>how</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>’). Decisions regarding resumption of&#xD;sporting activity must be based on objective medical information&#xD;regarding the transmission of COVID-19. Federal, State/Territory&#xD;and/or Local Public Health Authorities must be closely consulted in&#xD;decisions regarding the timing of resumption of sport (the ‘</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal"
>when</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>’).&#xD;The AIS Framework will be updated to reflect the evolving evidence&#xD;regarding COVID-19. While navigating the return to sport, organisations&#xD;must ensure that the health and wellbeing of athletes and&#xD;other personnel informs decision making. The overriding priority&#xD;for sport must ensure that any return to activity does not endanger&#xD;public health.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="22" rect="637.179993,235.063416,821.179993,327.063416"
/></highlight
></annots
><f href="10.1016_j.jsams.2020.05.004.pdf"
/><ids
/></xfdf
>